o<on_abort> sub
M65 P1 (ned: clear the tool-change-in-progress flag on any abort)
M65 P3 (ned: RETRACT THE TOOLSETTER PUCK on any abort)
(an aborted probe cycle must never leave it deployed in the envelope)

M5 (Spindle Stop)
M9 (Coolant Off)
M50 P1
G90 (Absolute Positioning)
G40 (Cancel Cutter Radius Compensation)

o<on_abort> endsub
M2 (end program)